# The CLI recording in the README: docs/assets/plan.gif
Output out/plan.gif

Require diskgc

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1440
Set Height 1060
Set Padding 18
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type "bash /usr/local/share/diskgc-demo/setup.sh && clear" Enter
Sleep 25s
Show

Type "diskgc plan" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "clear" Enter
Type "diskgc clean" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 7s
